<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bricolage+Grotesque:wght@500&family=Poppins&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <style>
      * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
      body { font-family: "Poppins", sans-serif; color: #474747; width: 100%; background-color: #fff; line-height: 1.6; }
      .header { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #004174 0%, #00568f 100%); width: 100%; height: 112px; text-align: center; display: table; }
      .header-content { display: table-cell; vertical-align: middle; }
      .header img { width: 149px; height: 32px; }
      .content { font-family: "Poppins", sans-serif; padding: 32px 20px; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; }
      .title { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; color: #004174; margin-bottom: 24px; }
      .body-content p { margin-bottom: 16px; }
      .alert-box { background-color: #fff8e1; border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b; padding: 16px 20px; border-radius: 4px; margin: 24px 0; }
      .alert-box p { margin: 0; font-weight: 500; }
      .btn { display: inline-block; margin-top: 24px; padding: 14px 28px; background-color: #004174; color: #ffffff !important; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px; }
      .url-note { margin-top: 12px; font-size: 13px; color: #6b7280; word-break: break-all; }
      .signature { margin-top: 32px; }
      .footer { background-color: #f9f9f9; padding: 32px 16px; text-align: center; }
      .footer-logo img { width: 35px; height: 25px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
      .social-links { margin: 16px auto; }
      .social-links a { text-decoration: none; vertical-align: middle; display: inline-block; padding: 0 6px; }
      .social-links img { width: 24px; height: 24px; border: 0; }
      .copyright { margin: 16px auto; font-size: 13px; color: #6b7280; }
      .footer-links a { text-decoration: none; color: #a3a3a3; font-size: 13px; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="header">
      <div class="header-content">
        <img src="https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/cvtocareer-394713.appspot.com/o/laigusbucket%2FC2C.png?alt=media&token=2c05d23e-1974-4a83-8143-99c1b6b96801" alt="CV To Career" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
      <h1 class="title">Action Required: Missing Profile Information</h1>

      <div class="body-content">
        <p>Dear <strong><%= name %></strong>,</p>

        <p>
          Our team has reviewed your profile and noticed that some important information is missing.
          To continue processing your application and ensure the best possible results, we need you
          to provide the following:
        </p>

        <div class="alert-box">
          <p>Missing: <strong><%= missingField %></strong></p>
        </div>

        <% if (jobUrl) { %>
        <p>
          This information is required in relation to the following job opportunity:
          <a href="<%= jobUrl %>" style="color: #004174;"><%= jobUrl %></a>
        </p>
        <% } %>

        <p>
          Please click the button below to update your profile with the required information.
          This link will take you directly to the relevant section of your account.
        </p>

        <a href="<%= updateMissingInfoUrl %>" class="btn">Update My Profile</a>

        <p class="url-note">
          Or copy this link into your browser:<br />
          <%= updateMissingInfoUrl %>
        </p>

        <p style="margin-top: 24px;">
          If you have any questions or need assistance, please don't hesitate to reach out to
          our support team at <a href="mailto:deliveryteam@cvtocareer.com" style="color: #004174;">deliveryteam@cvtocareer.com</a>.
        </p>

        <div class="signature">
          <p>Kind regards,<br />The CVtoCAREER Team</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <div class="footer-logo">
        <img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/cvtocareer-394713.appspot.com/laigusbucket/bea7d3a092f0710b014b1f203.png?GoogleAccessId=firebase-adminsdk-f76vf%40cvtocareer-394713.iam.gserviceaccount.com&Expires=4070905200&Signature=gWB9jqmAcwN9nLbugMdOj%2FD0BROrGRX4a8qnGa9cZGuOkc0Z2M9itk0pzUtoUtyedrxv%2B2hO%2BFqDqlduJ6J7WqVBAJ3wQ17oe72S5BwTvRXEY3Q7OM%2B9wuxsFsSwgrtfldf79sly6nIJQCXqb94FDFL661YxCbeGN%2BIq0j2volsUvmKtParJXXLo3LO%2BBmOms1nVf6HHldXbD%2FfMno5f%2FB8wj%2FLDF%2FvMk5LfTsISh0kSOXmvfRNQvktImOAH2rTt%2B6ejVByGrxstPLhViGGI0BSIWEOn0oFaihxHK3Lo%2B3T0WePp5Q0PoYFrERpTtGReyZFGIVc%2Bs%2B9PReVzHoL86g%3D%3D" alt="CVtoCAREER" />
      </div>
      <div class="social-links">
        <a href="https://facebook.com"><img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/cvtocareer-394713.appspot.com/footer/c2c_footer_fb.png" alt="Facebook" /></a>
        <a href="https://x.com"><img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/cvtocareer-394713.appspot.com/footer/c2c_footer_x.png" alt="X" /></a>
        <a href="https://youtube.com"><img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/cvtocareer-394713.appspot.com/footer/c2c_footer_yt.png" alt="YouTube" /></a>
        <a href="mailto:deliveryteam@cvtocareer.com"><img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/cvtocareer-394713.appspot.com/footer/c2c_footer_gmail.png" alt="Email" /></a>
        <a href="https://instagram.com"><img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/cvtocareer-394713.appspot.com/footer/c2c_footer_ig.png" alt="Instagram" /></a>
        <a href="https://linkedin.com"><img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/cvtocareer-394713.appspot.com/footer/c2c_footer_linkedin.png" alt="LinkedIn" /></a>
      </div>
      <p class="copyright">© <%= currentYear %> CVtoCAREER. All rights reserved.</p>
      <div class="footer-links">
        <a href="https://cvtocareer.com/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>
        &nbsp;&nbsp;|&nbsp;&nbsp;
        <a href="https://cvtocareer.com">Web</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
